2177
01:32:00,780 --> 01:32:07,700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ang ehensyang ito ay mahalagang tungkulin at yakin na ang bawat pamilyang Pilipino ay may disenting tirahan.

2178
01:32:07,700 --> 01:32:12,700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At yung pinangarap natin na sana na walang...

2179
01:32:13,260 --> 01:32:13,700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Wala dapat...

2180
01:32:14,820 --> 01:32:19,400
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Walang dapat na squatter sa sarili nating bayan.

2181
01:32:20,000 --> 01:32:28,200
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kaya bawat pisong inilaan natin para sa pabahay ay dapat direktang mapakinabangan ng mga pamilyang higit na nangangailangan.

2182
01:32:28,360 --> 01:32:30,760
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Lalong-lalo na po yung mga mahirap nating kababayan.

2183
01:32:31,460 --> 01:32:40,280
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: The proposed 2027 NEP allocates a total budget of 5.499 billion for the Dishud.

2184
01:32:40,280 --> 01:32:44,780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: This is 9.5 lower than the 2026 total program budget.

2185
01:32:44,820 --> 01:32:48,940
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Of 6.079 billion.

2186
01:32:49,740 --> 01:32:58,480
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: While the proposed budget is reduced, the need for decent and affordable housing has not diminished.

2187
01:32:59,020 --> 01:33:05,100
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: In fact, with the rising cost of land and construction materials at sa taas po ng presyo ng bilihin,

2188
01:33:05,280 --> 01:33:10,000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: lalong nagiging mahirap para sa ordinaryong Pilipino na magkaroon ng sariling tahanan.

2189
01:33:10,000 --> 01:33:14,500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sa kakaikot ko po sa buong bansa, nakikita kong kalagayan ng ating mga kababayan.

2190
01:33:14,820 --> 01:33:22,560
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sunog, baha, lindol, putok ng bulkan, mga sakuna. Maraming sa ating mga kababayan po ang nangangailangan ng tulong sa pabahay.

2191
01:33:23,120 --> 01:33:27,840
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sana po ay mas paigtingin pa ng Dishud ang kanilang mga programang magbibigay tulong sa kanila.

2192
01:33:28,400 --> 01:33:31,540
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Lalo na yung mga walang matakbuhan kundi po ang gobyerno.

2193
01:33:32,380 --> 01:33:35,920
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Meron lang po akong katanungan about the housing backlog.

2194
01:33:36,880 --> 01:33:41,940
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mr. Chair, the magnitude of our country's housing problem remains a serious concern.

2195
01:33:41,940 --> 01:33:43,940
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: For years, government estimates placed a...

2196
01:33:44,820 --> 01:33:49,400
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: the country's housing need at around 6.5 million units.

2197
01:33:50,100 --> 01:33:59,440
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: With the earlier projections warning that housing requirements could reach as high as 22 million units by 2040

2198
01:33:59,440 --> 01:34:03,100
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: if left not addressed.

2199
01:34:03,980 --> 01:34:08,620
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kung hindi po ito ma-address, it could reach as high as 22 million units

2200
01:34:08,620 --> 01:34:11,840
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: ang housing requirements na backlog.

2201
01:34:12,200 --> 01:34:14,640
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Dishud has recently stated that the actual...

2202
01:34:14,820 --> 01:34:19,720
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: the housing backlog is approximately 2.2 million units.

2203
01:34:22,620 --> 01:34:25,520
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sino pong sasagot nito? Dishud, no? Sekretary Aliling.

2204
01:34:27,020 --> 01:34:31,740
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Mr. Chair, based on the latest PSA study,

2205
01:34:32,500 --> 01:34:38,920
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ang forecast natin sa housing need by 2028 is 3.7 million units.

2206
01:34:39,280 --> 01:34:41,260
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Broken down as follows.

2207
01:34:41,260 --> 01:34:44,160
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Number one, 1.1 million.

2208
01:34:44,820 --> 01:34:49,460
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ito po yung may mga sariling tahanan, unit kailangan i-rehabilitate or ayusin.

2209
01:34:50,100 --> 01:34:55,080
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So most likely, nandyan po sa 1.1 million na yan, yung mga informal settler families.

2210
01:34:55,580 --> 01:35:00,620
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ang solution po na nakikita natin dyan under the 4PH is the community mortgage program.

2211
01:35:01,380 --> 01:35:04,500
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Para pag na-award po sa kanila yung kanilang mga tinitirhan,

2212
01:35:05,160 --> 01:35:09,980
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: mas mainganyo silang magpaayos, magpa-repair ng mga tahanan nila.

2213
01:35:09,980 --> 01:35:14,200
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Then the second is the 2.2 million na tinatawag natin double up.

2214
01:35:14,820 --> 01:35:19,720
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ito pong double up, ito po yung may multiple families living under one roof.

2215
01:35:20,860 --> 01:35:29,020
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So ito po, buong span po ito, hindi lang ito socialized housing, pati open market kasama rito.

2216
01:35:29,540 --> 01:35:38,640
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So kahit na may kaya yung pamilya, basta more than one family ang nakatira, kasama po sila dito sa 2.2.

2217
01:35:38,640 --> 01:35:44,660
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Then the 400,000 remaining of the 3.7 million is yung forecast nung neto,

2218
01:35:44,660 --> 01:35:47,280
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: na masisira at maayos.

2219
01:35:47,500 --> 01:35:51,540
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So yung po yung 3.7 million, ang gusto lang po natin yung highlight dito,

2220
01:35:52,120 --> 01:35:58,840
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: na yung 4PH po, pag na-expand natin ito, napalago natin, naparami natin yung output nito,

2221
01:35:59,020 --> 01:36:06,400
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: should ultimately help resolve the projected housing need of 3.7 million by 2028.

2222
01:36:07,380 --> 01:36:12,500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Salamat. Pwede natin pasingitin muna natin ang Mr. Trabajador ng Senado.

2223
01:36:12,700 --> 01:36:14,500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kasi hindi lang po kami...

2224
01:36:14,660 --> 01:36:20,300
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Trabajador dito, lagari rin po kami, konektado po itong housing. Lagari yung trabaho.

2225
